	</sbsgroup>
</figure>

	<activity xml:id="activity-possible-extrema">
		<title>Conditions for Extrema</title>
		<introduction><p>The goal of this activity is to discover properties of curves that have specific types of extrema.</p></introduction>
		<task><p>Draw one curve for each of the following sets of conditions.</p>
		<p><ol>
			<li>One relative maximum, two relative minima</li>
			<li>One relative minimum, two relative maxima</li>
			<li>One relative minimum, no relative maxima</li>
			<li>Two relative minima, no relative maxima</li>
			<li>One absolute maximum, one absolute minimum</li>
			<li>One absolute maximum, two absolute minima</li>
			<li>One absolute maximum, two relative maxima</li>
			<li>No absolute maximum</li>
		</ol></p>
		</task>
		<task><p>Conjecture conditions for when absolute extrema must exist.</p></task>
	</activity>

</subsection>

</section>
